# Air Trial - Elemental Battle Cutscene
# Features light, airy music, themes of freedom and agility, and the Air Elemental encounter

@backdrop textures/temple.gif [fadeIn=800]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char AIR_ELEMENTAL sprite=monsters/air_elemental

@do playBgm [name=audio/icy-passage.mp3]

wait 800

# The Air Elemental descends

*AIR_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
The winds carry tales of your journey...
Three shards already. Impressive.
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
The final elemental trial!
I'm so close to completing my quest!
"""

wait 500

AIR_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Fire, Water, Earth... all grounded.
But I am the SKY! Untouchable!
Can you catch the wind itself?
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/dial-in.mp3]

wait 600

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=worried]
"""
The wind moves so fast...
How can I possibly keep up?
"""

wait 800

@transition wipe [duration=500]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/room.gif [fadeIn=600]
@do playBgm [name=audio/lonely-mountain.mp3]

# The trial of agility

AIR_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
The wind doesn't fight.
It flows. It dances. It evades.
To catch me, you must BECOME the wind!
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=tired,position=left]
"""
I can't... hit anything...
Every strike... meets empty air...
"""

wait 600

*AIR_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
Still thinking like an earthbound creature!
Free your mind! Embrace the moment!
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Free my mind... embrace the moment...
I understand now!
Don't chase where you ARE...
Anticipate where you'll BE!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/dungeon-beat.mp3]

@action HERO moveTo [x=60,duration=400]

wait 800

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=500]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/temple.gif [fadeIn=600]
@do playBgm [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

# Victory

AIR_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
You... caught me!
In all my millennia... only you...
"""

wait 500

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
I learned to read the wind patterns!
To see where the current flows next!
"""

*AIR_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
The Air Shard is yours, hero.
You have mastered all four elements!
Fire's passion, Water's flow,
Earth's endurance, Air's freedom!
"""

wait 800

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Four shards... the seal is within reach!
Time to face the Dark Lord!
"""

@do playBgm [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

@transition wipe [duration=700]

waitInput

@end
